#: useragentdlg.cpp:357
msgid ""
"<h1>User Agent</h1>The user agent control screen allows you to have full "
"control over what type of browser konqueror will report itself as to remote "
"web site machines.  The default is <br/><b>%1</b><br/><p>Some web sites, "
"however, do not function properly if they think they are talking to browsers "
"other than the latest Netscape or Internet Explorer. For these sites, you "
"may wantto override the default to something else. "
msgstr ""

#: useragentdlg.cpp:365
msgid ""
"<p><ul><li>In the box labeled, <em>When connecting to</em>, you can enter "
"the server you are interested in fooling, such as <em>my.yahoo.com</em>.  To "
"change the user agent string for every location under one site, enter only "
"the common part of the site's name. For example, <em>yahoo.com</em> will "
"match everything at that site.<li>In the box labeled, <em>Send user agent "
"string</em>, you can choose the user agent string from one of the predefined "
"entries or enter your own string, for example <em>Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; "
"MSIE 4.0)</em>.<li>In the box labeled, <em>Alias for useragent string</em>, "
"you can enter a more common name to remember the associated agent string "
"by.</ul>"
msgstr ""

